  "title": "Super Loaded Chili Potato Skins",
  "description": "This super-loaded chili potato skins recipe bakes potatoes until skins are crisp, fills with chili and cheese, and tops with sour cream and green onions.",
  "authors": [
    "HORMEL CHILIR"
